{"seq":63,"slug":"kubernetes-storage-csi-statefulset-stateful-workload","title":"Kubernetes 存储与有状态工作负载：CSI、PV/PVC、StorageClass、StatefulSet 与数据保护","stage":"DONE","category":"cloud-infrastructure","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/kubernetes-storage-csi-statefulset-stateful-workload","rating":{"composite":4.1,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":4,"coverage":3.75,"positioning":4,"strategic":4.67},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"kubernetes-存储与有状态工作负载导论-简介\">Kubernetes 存储与有状态工作负载导论 简介</h1><p>无状态工作负载在 Kubernetes 里近乎&quot;随手拈来&quot;：Pod 挂了重建，副本数随流量涨落，节点宕机调度到别处即可。一旦涉及数据，整套假设同时失效——数据必须活过 Pod 的生命周期，必须绑定到正确的实例，必须在节点漂移、扩缩容与灾难中仍然可恢复。Kubernetes 的存储抽象正是为回答这三个&quot;必须&quot;而存在，它把&quot;数据放在哪&quot;和&quot;数据怎么被使用&quot;拆成两层，用声明式接口把二者的耦合收敛到可控范围内。这个 hub 讲的不是&quot;怎么挂一个盘&quot;，而是当有状态负载在生产中出问题时，你能定位到底卡在卷绑定、CSI 驱动、StatefulSet 编排还是数据保护中的哪一环。</p>\n<p>第一章建立底座，从卷抽象与 PV/PVC/StorageClass 的绑定模型讲起（见 <a href=\"volume-pv-pvc-storageclass/volume-lifecycle-pv-pvc-binding-model\">卷生命周期与 PV/PVC 绑定模型</a>）。真正让工程师反复踩坑的往往不是&quot;创建卷&quot;，而是访问模式（AccessModes）的真实含义、回收策略（ReclaimPolicy）与 binding 时机之间的相互约束，以及为什么同一个 PVC 有时 Pending 有时却瞬间绑定（见 <a href=\"volume-pv-pvc-storageclass/access-modes-reclaim-binding-mechanism\">访问模式、回收策略与绑定机制</a>）。最后落到扩容、拓扑约束与挂载排障这三个日常高频场景——线上绝大多数&quot;卷挂不上&quot;都能在这一层找到根因（见 <a href=\"volume-pv-pvc-storageclass/volume-expansion-topology-mount-troubleshooting\">卷扩容、拓扑与挂载排障</a>）。</p>\n<p>第二章向下进入 CSI 这一实现层。PV/PVC 是面向使用者的接口，而真正与云盘、分布式文件系统、本地盘对话的是 CSI 驱动；理解 Controller/Node 两组插件的职责划分与它们之间的契约，是读懂后续一切存储行为的前提（见 <a href=\"csi-driver-dynamic-provisioning/csi-architecture-interface-contract\">CSI 架构与接口契约</a>）。在此之上展开动态供给、StorageClass 参数化与快照能力，解释&quot;为什么同一份 YAML 在不同集群行为不同&quot;（见 <a href=\"csi-driver-dynamic-provisioning/dynamic-provisioning-storageclass-snapshot\">动态供给、StorageClass 与快照</a>），再收束到拓扑感知、Node 插件与驱动升级这些运维细节（见 <a href=\"csi-driver-dynamic-provisioning/csi-topology-node-plugin-upgrade-ops\">CSI 拓扑、Node 插件与升级运维</a>）。</p>\n<p>第三章把视角抬回编排层。StatefulSet 解决的是&quot;稳定身份 + 稳定存储&quot;这对耦合需求：有序命名、有序启停、网络标识与 VolumeClaimTemplate 共同构成了有状态负载的一致性边界的表达方式（见 <a href=\"statefulset-stateful-patterns/statefulset-identity-ordering-model\">StatefulSet 身份与有序性模型</a>）。这里最容易出错的不是 YAML 语法，而是 PVC 的保留与复用语义、滚动更新时卷如何随 Pod 迁移（见 <a href=\"statefulset-stateful-patterns/volumeclaimtemplate-pvc-retention-update\">VolumeClaimTemplate、PVC 保留与更新</a>），以及扩缩容过程中可能出现的脑裂风险（见 <a href=\"statefulset-stateful-patterns/stateful-rollout-scaling-split-brain\">有状态滚动、扩缩容与脑裂</a>）。</p>\n<p>第四章收束到数据保护与灾备。有状态系统的价值全部押在数据上，因此备份不是运维的可选项而是设计的一部分：快照与恢复的语义模型、一致性快照为什么难做（见 <a href=\"data-protection-dr-storage-ops/backup-snapshot-restore-model\">备份、快照与恢复模型</a>）。工程上还要回答应用一致性备份与跨集群迁移如何落地（见 <a href=\"data-protection-dr-storage-ops/velero-app-consistent-migration\">Velero、应用一致性与迁移</a>），并最终把灾备切换、容量规划与合规治理串成可运营的闭环（见 <a href=\"data-protection-dr-storage-ops/dr-failover-capacity-compliance-governance\">灾备切换、容量与合规治理</a>）。</p>\n<p>四章合起来是一条自洽的链：第一章定义使用者如何声明与消费存储，第二章解释这些声明如何被驱动翻译成真实存储行为，第三章给出有状态负载如何稳定地占用这些存储，第四章保证数据在任何故障下都还能回来。读完之后，你应当能面对一次 PVC Pending、一次挂载失败、一次扩容卡住或一次恢复演练失败，判断问题出在抽象层、驱动层、编排层还是数据保护层，而不是停在&quot;删了重建试试&quot;。</p>\n<p><strong>边界说明：</strong> 本 hub 聚焦 Kubernetes 存储抽象、CSI 生态、StatefulSet 编排与数据保护这条纵向链路。同分类下讲容器运行时与内核隔离、CNI 数据面、etcd 一致性、Operator 模式的 hub 处理各自领域，本 hub 只在 StatefulSet 与运维落点上与之相邻；Linux 层面的块设备、文件系统与持久内存属于操作系统/存储底层主题，本 hub 不重复其通用体系。</p>\n<p><strong>前置知识：</strong> 熟悉 Kubernetes 基本工作流（Pod/Deployment/Service、kubectl 排查、YAML 声明式管理）；了解云盘、块存储与文件系统的基本概念；对容器挂载与命名空间有概念性认识即可，无需深入内核细节。</p>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"volume-pv-pvc-storageclass","title":"卷、PV/PVC 与 StorageClass 模型","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/kubernetes-storage-csi-statefulset-stateful-workload/volume-pv-pvc-storageclass","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"volume-lifecycle-pv-pvc-binding-model","title":"卷抽象与 PV/PVC 生命周期绑定模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/kubernetes-storage-csi-statefulset-stateful-workload/volume-pv-pvc-storageclass/volume-lifecycle-pv-pvc-binding-model"},{"seq":2,"slug":"access-modes-reclaim-binding-mechanism","title":"访问模式、回收策略与绑定调度机制","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/kubernetes-storage-csi-statefulset-stateful-workload/volume-pv-pvc-storageclass/access-modes-reclaim-binding-mechanism"},{"seq":3,"slug":"volume-expansion-topology-mount-troubleshooting","title":"卷扩容、拓扑感知与挂载失败排查","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/kubernetes-storage-csi-statefulset-stateful-workload/volume-pv-pvc-storageclass/volume-expansion-topology-mount-troubleshooting"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"csi-driver-dynamic-provisioning","title":"CSI 驱动与动态供给","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/kubernetes-storage-csi-statefulset-stateful-workload/csi-driver-dynamic-provisioning","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"csi-architecture-interface-contract","title":"CSI 架构与控制器/节点接口契约","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/kubernetes-storage-csi-statefulset-stateful-workload/csi-driver-dynamic-provisioning/csi-architecture-interface-contract"},{"seq":2,"slug":"dynamic-provisioning-storageclass-snapshot","title":"动态供给、StorageClass 参数与卷快照","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/kubernetes-storage-csi-statefulset-stateful-workload/csi-driver-dynamic-provisioning/dynamic-provisioning-storageclass-snapshot"},{"seq":3,"slug":"csi-topology-node-plugin-upgrade-ops","title":"CSI 拓扑、节点插件故障与驱动升级运维","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/kubernetes-storage-csi-statefulset-stateful-workload/csi-driver-dynamic-provisioning/csi-topology-node-plugin-upgrade-ops"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"statefulset-stateful-patterns","title":"StatefulSet 与有状态工作负载模式","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/kubernetes-storage-csi-statefulset-stateful-workload/statefulset-stateful-patterns","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"statefulset-identity-ordering-model","title":"StatefulSet 身份、稳定网络与有序编排模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/kubernetes-storage-csi-statefulset-stateful-workload/statefulset-stateful-patterns/statefulset-identity-ordering-model"},{"seq":2,"slug":"volumeclaimtemplate-pvc-retention-update","title":"volumeClaimTemplate、PVC 保留与更新策略","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/kubernetes-storage-csi-statefulset-stateful-workload/statefulset-stateful-patterns/volumeclaimtemplate-pvc-retention-update"},{"seq":3,"slug":"stateful-rollout-scaling-split-brain","title":"有状态滚动更新、扩缩容与脑裂异常处置","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/kubernetes-storage-csi-statefulset-stateful-workload/statefulset-stateful-patterns/stateful-rollout-scaling-split-brain"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"data-protection-dr-storage-ops","title":"数据保护、容灾与存储运维","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/kubernetes-storage-csi-statefulset-stateful-workload/data-protection-dr-storage-ops","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"backup-snapshot-restore-model","title":"备份、快照与恢复的 RPO/RTO 模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/kubernetes-storage-csi-statefulset-stateful-workload/data-protection-dr-storage-ops/backup-snapshot-restore-model"},{"seq":2,"slug":"velero-app-consistent-migration","title":"Velero 应用一致性备份与跨集群迁移","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/kubernetes-storage-csi-statefulset-stateful-workload/data-protection-dr-storage-ops/velero-app-consistent-migration"},{"seq":3,"slug":"dr-failover-capacity-compliance-governance","title":"容灾切换、容量成本与存储合规治理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/kubernetes-storage-csi-statefulset-stateful-workload/data-protection-dr-storage-ops/dr-failover-capacity-compliance-governance"}]}]}